---
import SubpageLayout from '../../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---

<SubpageLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Our Team"
  subtitle="Born problem-solvers. Based in Groningen, AI Capital of Europe."
  seoTitle="The team behind AI Heroes: Frans, David and Jan"
  accentColor="blue"
  seoDescription="The team behind AI Heroes: Frans Hoorn (business case and scoping), David Homan (build and compliance) and Jan Brusse (adoption and training). The current team since late 2025, based in Groningen."
>
  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif text-brand-dark mb-6">The people behind AI Heroes</h2>

    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">In late 2025 Frans, David and Jan took over the AI Heroes brand and started again, with one project path in which each of them carries a phase: the business case, the build and the adoption. Based in Groningen, serving all of Europe.</p>

    <div class="space-y-12 mb-12 not-prose">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 bg-stone-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><img src="/team/frans.webp" alt="Frans Hoorn" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top scale-125 brightness-110 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300" /></div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-brand-dark mb-1">Frans Hoorn</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-red font-medium mb-3">Co-Founder · Business case & scoping</p>
          <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Combines strategic thinking with a sharp eye for user experience. Leads the start sprint and the business case: what it costs, what it returns and when it pays back. With a background in UX/UI design and product management, he knows how to turn a vague question into a scope a team can build on.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 bg-stone-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><img src="/team/david.webp" alt="David Homan" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top scale-125 brightness-110 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300" /></div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-brand-dark mb-1">David Homan</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-red font-medium mb-3">Co-Founder · Build & compliance</p>
          <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">The link between tech and boardroom. Understands how AI models work under the hood (from transformers to image generation) and translates that knowledge into what it means for your business processes. Builds with tools like GitHub Copilot and local AI models, giving him precise insight into what's technically possible and what's feasible within your organisation. Leads the build, from prototype to system in production, and makes sure AI Act classification, logging, oversight and hosting are part of the design.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 bg-stone-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><img src="/team/jan.webp" alt="Jan Brusse" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top scale-125 brightness-110 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300" /></div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-brand-dark mb-1">Jan Brusse</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-red font-medium mb-3">Co-Founder · Adoption & training</p>
          <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Specialist in making complex technology accessible. Has spent years building an innovation lab where he trained thousands of people in new technologies, from beginners to experts. Knows like no other how to turn a tough subject into an interactive, practical session that sticks. Makes sure the team that will work with the system can actually work with it: training on the system itself, on the work floor, with the proof for Article 4 of the AI Act included.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-stone-200 pt-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-20 h-20 bg-stone-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><img src="/team/joseph.png" alt="Joseph Groot Kormelink" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale" /></div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif text-brand-dark mb-1">Joseph Groot Kormelink</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-blue font-medium mb-2 text-sm">Industry Advisor</p>
          <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">Well-known in Amsterdam's AI and startup scene. Advises on enterprise matters.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dark-box-content bg-brand-dark p-8 border-l-4 border-brand-blue my-8 not-prose">
      <h3>Tell us what you want to build</h3>
      <p>A start sprint is the first step. Below you can tell us what it is about; we respond within 24 hours.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</SubpageLayout>
